    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d610">

                <pb facs="0704" n="632" sameAs="frus:frus1909/pg632"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 14457/71–73.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Beaupre to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The
                            Hague</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1909-04-20"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">April 20, 1909</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 133.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Supplementing my telegram of to-day,<anchor
                        n="1" xml:id="d610-f1"/> I have the honor herewith to transmit a copy of the
                    protocol signed yesterday by the <pb facs="0705" n="633" xml:id="pg633"/>
                    minister for foreign affairs of the Netherlands and Dr. de Paúl, special
                    delegate for that purpose of the Government of Venezuela. A translation
                    accompanies the same. I inclose further the statement of the minister for
                    foreign affairs that accompanied the protocol to the States General, cut from
                    Het Vaderland, of the 21st instant, with a translation thereof.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">A. M. Beaupré.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d610-a1.xml" xpointer="d610-a1"/>
